id: super-saiyan-3-even-further-beyond
name: Even Further Beyond
order: 2
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (1) Power High, Long Transformation, Exhausting and 2 levels of Draining lost.
aspects: -Power High, -Long Transformation, -Exhausting, -Draining (LV2)
description: >
  You have pushed past the limits of your power, becoming even stronger.
text: >
  Even Further Beyond (1): You have pushed past the limits of your power, becoming even stronger.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Super Saiyan 3 loses the Power High, Long Transformation, and the Exhausting Aspects, and 2 levels of the Draining Aspect.
  (2)-[Passive]: Ignore the 3rd effect of Limitless.

---

# (2) Limitless (3) ignored.
[passive, effect 2]
allow kiRegain.kept;
